---
import { BookOpen, Layers, Leaf } from "lucide-react";
---

<section class="py-16 bg-surface text-ink dark:bg-ink dark:text-surface">
  <div class="hypsa-container mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-surface/60 bg-surface/90 p-8 shadow-sm dark:border-surface/20 dark:bg-ink/80">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-forest/10 text-forest dark:bg-beige/10 dark:text-beige">
          <Layers class="h-6 w-6" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-surface font-heading">Diverse Landscapes</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/80 dark:text-surface/80">
          From tropical forests to alpine volcanic terrain.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-surface/60 bg-surface/90 p-8 shadow-sm dark:border-surface/20 dark:bg-ink/80">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-forest/10 text-forest dark:bg-beige/10 dark:text-beige">
          <BookOpen class="h-6 w-6" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-surface font-heading">Cultural Heritage</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/80 dark:text-surface/80">
          Many mountains hold spiritual and cultural significance.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-surface/60 bg-surface/90 p-8 shadow-sm dark:border-surface/20 dark:bg-ink/80">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-forest/10 text-forest dark:bg-beige/10 dark:text-beige">
          <Leaf class="h-6 w-6" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-surface font-heading">Unique Biodiversity</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/80 dark:text-surface/80">
          Home to endemic flora and fauna.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
